                                        "entry_id": "4befbc28-013a-33db-9600-4240eb6b53d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person that leases real property; a lessor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7530885a-636f-486d-933b-b895410316b5",
                                                "sense_id": "84194766-5e83-3bef-a439-2c4c119939ea",
                                                "text": "Brethren, brethren, it were better to haue this communitie,\nThen to haue this difference in degrees:\nThe landlord his rent, the lawyer his fees.\nSo quickly the poore mans ſubſtance is ſpent […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c2eecb5-29f7-3b32-8059-ebd997da64bb",
                                        "entry_id": "4befbc28-013a-33db-9600-4240eb6b53d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The owner or manager of a public house."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18ec27c3-fa85-4a70-b494-79ecec76c7e4",
                                                "sense_id": "9c2eecb5-29f7-3b32-8059-ebd997da64bb",
                                                "text": "When asked to explain why he became a landlord, he told the Archbishop of York it was so he could close the pub on Sundays, and suppress the profane language and singing that came through the bar windows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "358caf9f-e361-349b-b1f7-a556599d9cb2",
